# Public source allowlist. Local software, settings and test evidence stay private.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/启动.cmd
!/.github/
!/源码/
!/资料/
/资料/*
!/资料/使用说明.md
!/资料/开源致谢.md
!/测试/
/测试/*
!/测试/残留检测验证/
/测试/残留检测验证/*
!/测试/残留检测验证/Program.cs
!/测试/残留检测验证/ResidueChecks.csproj
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
**/*.pdb
**/error.log
